{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"k001","type":"text","x":0,"y":-100,"width":4640,"height":260,"text":"# 宏观 → 行业 → 公司 → 现金与价值\n\n[[02_Economy/06_证券投资学/04_宏观到公司基本面|连续阅读与贯穿算例]] · [[基本面分析|基本面分析定义]]\n\n三列分别回答：环境发生什么、竞争留下什么、公司怎样把它变成现金与价值。缩放进入分区；箭头写明关系，卡片打开同一个共享原子。颜色区分分析层次，不表示掌握程度。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe columns ask what changes in the environment, what competition leaves to firms, and how a business turns this into cash and value. Zoom into a section; arrows state relationships and cards open shared atoms. Colors indicate analytical layers, not mastery.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"mdata","type":"group","label":"宏观｜先认清观测的量","x":0,"y":400,"width":1440,"height":1540,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"k11","type":"text","x":40,"y":470,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[国内生产总值]]\n\n生产流量，不是证券回报。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA production flow, not a security return.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k12","type":"text","x":900,"y":470,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[实际GDP增长]]\n\n先去价格因素，再比较产出。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCompare output after removing price changes.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k13","type":"text","x":40,"y":850,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[通货膨胀]]\n\n关注一般价格水平的上升。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA rise in the general price level.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k14","type":"text","x":900,"y":850,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[通胀率与价格水平]]\n\n涨得慢了，不等于价格下降。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSlower inflation is not a falling price level.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k15","type":"text","x":40,"y":1230,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[通货紧缩]]\n\n识别价格下跌的来源与传导。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIdentify the source and transmission of falling prices.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k16","type":"text","x":900,"y":1230,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[失业率]]\n\n分母是劳动力，不是总人口。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe denominator is the labour force, not total population.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k17","type":"text","x":40,"y":1610,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[潜在产出]]\n\n可持续供给能力需要估计。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSustainable productive capacity must be estimated.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k18","type":"text","x":900,"y":1610,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[产出缺口]]\n\n把实际产出与潜在产出比较。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCompare actual with potential output.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"mmodel","type":"group","label":"宏观｜从曲线解释冲击","x":0,"y":2100,"width":1440,"height":1540,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"k19","type":"text","x":40,"y":2170,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[经济周期]]\n\n扩张与收缩没有固定钟摆周期。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nExpansion and contraction have no fixed periodicity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k20","type":"text","x":900,"y":2170,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[总需求]]\n\n给定价格水平下的总支出需求。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAggregate expenditure demand at a given price level.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k21","type":"text","x":40,"y":2550,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[短期总供给]]\n\n短期成本与价格黏性进入供给。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nShort-run costs and nominal rigidity affect supply.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k22","type":"text","x":900,"y":2550,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[长期总供给]]\n\n长期供给取决于潜在产出。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nLong-run supply reflects potential output.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k23","type":"text","x":40,"y":2930,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[总需求冲击]]\n\n需求移动时，先固定供给条件。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nHold supply conditions fixed when shifting demand.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k24","type":"text","x":900,"y":2930,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[总供给冲击]]\n\n成本冲击可能使量价反向变化。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA cost shock can move output and prices oppositely.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k25","type":"text","x":40,"y":3310,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[AD-AS长期调整]]\n\n长期落点必须同时满足曲线假设。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe endpoint must satisfy all curve assumptions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"mpolicy","type":"group","label":"宏观｜把信息与政策接到资产","x":0,"y":3800,"width":1440,"height":2680,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"k26","type":"text","x":40,"y":3870,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[先行指标]]\n\n历史先行性不保证每次都提前。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nHistorical leads are not guaranteed leads.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k27","type":"text","x":900,"y":3870,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[同步指标]]\n\n判断当前活动仍要检查发布时滞。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAssessing current activity still requires release timing.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k28","type":"text","x":40,"y":4250,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[滞后指标]]\n\n转折之后确认，不是未来时钟。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nConfirmation after a turn is not a clock for the future.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k29","type":"text","x":900,"y":4250,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[经济数据的实时口径]]\n\n只用当时发布的版本做当时判断。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nUse the data vintage available at the decision date.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k30","type":"text","x":40,"y":4630,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[财政政策]]\n\n支出与税收改变总量和分配。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSpending and taxation affect activity and distribution.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k31","type":"text","x":900,"y":4630,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[货币政策]]\n\n政策工具通过金融条件影响经济。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPolicy instruments work through financial conditions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k32","type":"text","x":40,"y":5010,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[宏观增长与股票回报]]\n\n经济增长不直接决定股票回报。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEconomic growth does not determine equity returns.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k33","type":"text","x":900,"y":5010,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[政策传导的估值渠道]]\n\n分别追踪现金流、贴现与预期。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nTrace cash flows, discounting, and expectations separately.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k35","type":"text","x":40,"y":5390,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[汇率变动与企业价值]]\n\n先固定报价，再查业务与债务敞口。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFix the quote, then inspect business and debt exposures.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k39","type":"text","x":900,"y":5390,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[宏观情景分析]]\n\n同一情景要贯穿量价、成本与风险。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCarry one coherent scenario through operations and risk.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k36","type":"text","x":40,"y":5770,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[美林投资时钟]]\n\n增长与通胀形成条件性的阶段框架。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nGrowth and inflation define a conditional stage framework.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k37","type":"text","x":900,"y":5770,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[投资时钟阶段识别]]\n\n阶段取决于指标与比较口径。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nStage identification depends on indicators and definitions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k38","type":"text","x":40,"y":6150,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"6","text":"## [[投资时钟配置边界]]\n\n阶段标签不能直接变成交易指令。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA phase label is not an automatic trading instruction.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"ibound","type":"group","label":"行业｜界定市场与可比对象","x":1600,"y":400,"width":1440,"height":1540,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"k41","type":"text","x":1640,"y":470,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[行业]]\n\n产品、地域与分析目的界定边界。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nProducts, geography, and purpose define the boundary.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k42","type":"text","x":2500,"y":470,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[行业分析]]\n\n解释需求、竞争与利润如何变化。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nExplain changes in demand, competition, and profit.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k43","type":"text","x":1640,"y":850,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[行业可比样本选择]]\n\n先定比较目的，再筛选可比业务。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSpecify the comparison before selecting peer businesses.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k50","type":"text","x":2500,"y":850,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[市场份额]]\n\n公司与市场必须使用同一口径。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFirm and market need the same measurement basis.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k51","type":"text","x":1640,"y":1230,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[市场集中度]]\n\n刻画份额分布，不直接证明市场力。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nDescribe share distribution without assuming market power.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k52","type":"text","x":2500,"y":1230,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[行业集中率]]\n\n前若干家企业份额加总。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSum the shares of the largest firms.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k53","type":"text","x":1640,"y":1610,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[HHI指数]]\n\n份额平方和强调较大企业。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSquared shares put greater weight on large firms.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k54","type":"text","x":2500,"y":1610,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[集中度与竞争强度]]\n\n还要检查定价、替代与进入机制。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAlso inspect pricing, substitution, and entry.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"iforce","type":"group","label":"行业｜利润为什么留得住","x":1600,"y":2100,"width":1440,"height":1920,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"k55","type":"text","x":1640,"y":2170,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[波特五力]]\n\n竞争压力来自五种结构关系。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCompetitive pressure comes from five structural relationships.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k56","type":"text","x":2500,"y":2170,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[潜在进入者威胁]]\n\n尚未进入的竞争也能约束收益。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPotential entry can constrain returns before it occurs.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k57","type":"text","x":1640,"y":2550,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[进入壁垒]]\n\n识别新进入者面临的障碍。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIdentify obstacles faced by new entrants.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k58","type":"text","x":2500,"y":2550,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[退出壁垒]]\n\n难退出可能维持过剩供给。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nDifficult exit can sustain excess capacity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k59","type":"text","x":1640,"y":2930,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[买方议价能力]]\n\n客户可以争取价格或其他条款。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCustomers may bargain over price and other terms.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k60","type":"text","x":2500,"y":2930,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[供应商议价能力]]\n\n投入方能否保留更多价值？\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCan input suppliers capture more value?\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k61","type":"text","x":1640,"y":3310,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[替代品威胁]]\n\n用别的方式满足同一种需求。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nMeet the same need in a different way.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k62","type":"text","x":2500,"y":3310,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[行业内竞争]]\n\n现有企业争夺客户与利润。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIncumbents compete for customers and profit.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k65","type":"text","x":1640,"y":3690,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[规模经济]]\n\n产出规模增加可以降低平均成本。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA larger production scale can lower average cost.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k66","type":"text","x":2500,"y":3690,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[学习效应]]\n\n累计经验与当期规模不是同一变量。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCumulative experience differs from current scale.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"icycle","type":"group","label":"行业｜区分趋势、周期和阶段","x":1600,"y":4200,"width":1440,"height":1540,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"k44","type":"text","x":1640,"y":4270,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[成长型行业]]\n\n长期扩张仍可能遇到短期衰退。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nLong-run expansion can coexist with short-run contraction.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k45","type":"text","x":2500,"y":4270,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[周期型行业]]\n\n经营随整体经济波动较敏感。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nOperations are sensitive to aggregate fluctuations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k46","type":"text","x":1640,"y":4650,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[防御型行业]]\n\n需求较稳，不等于股票没有风险。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nStable demand does not make a stock risk-free.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k47","type":"text","x":2500,"y":4650,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[成长与周期敏感性]]\n\n长期趋势与短期敏感性分开判断。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAssess trend and cyclical sensitivity separately.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k48","type":"text","x":1640,"y":5030,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[行业生命周期]]\n\n采用、成长、成熟与衰退的框架。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA framework for adoption, growth, maturity, and decline.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k49","type":"text","x":2500,"y":5030,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[行业生命周期判断]]\n\n需求、产能与盈利证据交叉核对。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCross-check demand, capacity, and profitability.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k63","type":"text","x":1640,"y":5410,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[行业景气指标]]\n\n用经营信号观察行业活动。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nObserve industry activity through operating indicators.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k64","type":"text","x":2500,"y":5410,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"4","text":"## [[景气指标口径核对]]\n\n区分量价、库存与发布时点。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSeparate volume, price, inventories, and release timing.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"cquality","type":"group","label":"公司｜解释客户价值与经营优势","x":3200,"y":400,"width":1440,"height":1920,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k71","type":"text","x":3240,"y":470,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[商业模式]]\n\n谁付钱，怎样交付，如何留存价值。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nWho pays, how value is delivered, and how it is captured.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k72","type":"text","x":4100,"y":470,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[价值主张]]\n\n明确客户、需求与相对价格。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSpecify customers, needs, and relative price.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k73","type":"text","x":3240,"y":850,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[价值链]]\n\n从相互联系的活动寻找优势来源。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nLocate advantage in connected activities.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k74","type":"text","x":4100,"y":850,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[SWOT分析]]\n\n内外条件分类后仍要检验因果机制。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nClassifying conditions does not establish causation.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k75","type":"text","x":3240,"y":1230,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[成本领先]]\n\n相对低成本不等于单纯低售价。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA cost advantage is not merely a low selling price.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k76","type":"text","x":4100,"y":1230,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[差异化战略]]\n\n独特性须为客户重视。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nUniqueness must matter to customers.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k77","type":"text","x":3240,"y":1610,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[集聚战略]]\n\n竞争范围集中于选定细分市场。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFocus the competitive scope on selected segments.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k78","type":"text","x":4100,"y":1610,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[护城河证据]]\n\n把优势主张接到机制与反证。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nConnect advantage claims to mechanisms and falsifiers.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k79","type":"text","x":3240,"y":1990,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[网络效应]]\n\n参与者变化影响使用价值。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nChanges in participation affect usage value.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"ccash","type":"group","label":"公司｜量价怎样变成利润和现金","x":3200,"y":2500,"width":1440,"height":1160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k81","type":"text","x":3240,"y":2570,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[收入驱动预测]]\n\n先按业务拆数量、价格与组合。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nModel volume, price, and mix by business.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k82","type":"text","x":4100,"y":2570,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[经营杠杆]]\n\n固定成本放大利润对销售的反应。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFixed costs amplify profit sensitivity to sales.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k83","type":"text","x":3240,"y":2950,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[企业自由现金流]]\n\n经营税后并再投资后可分配的现金。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCash available after operating taxes and reinvestment.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k89","type":"text","x":4100,"y":2950,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[利润增长不等于现金增长]]\n\n增长可能先占用应收、存货与设备。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nGrowth may first absorb cash in working capital and assets.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k84","type":"text","x":3240,"y":3330,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[投入资本回报率]]\n\n经营利润与对应投入资本配对。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nMatch operating profit with the capital producing it.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k85","type":"text","x":4100,"y":3330,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"5","text":"## [[再投资增长关系]]\n\n增长要求投入与新增回报相容。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nGrowth must be consistent with investment and new returns.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"cvalue","type":"group","label":"价值｜价格、证据与更新","x":3200,"y":4000,"width":1440,"height":1160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"k86","type":"text","x":3240,"y":4070,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"2","text":"## [[增长不等于增值]]\n\n新增投资须补偿资本机会成本。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nNew investment must cover its opportunity cost.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"knpv","type":"text","x":4100,"y":4070,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"2","text":"## [[净现值决策]]\n\n复用财管课的增量现金流规则。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nReuse the incremental NPV rule from Corporate Finance.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k87","type":"text","x":3240,"y":4450,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"2","text":"## [[反向估值]]\n\n固定部分输入，反求价格隐含要求。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFix some inputs and infer price-implied requirements.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"knews","type":"text","x":4100,"y":4450,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"2","text":"## [[意外信息定价]]\n\n事前预期决定信息比较基准。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPrior expectations provide the information benchmark.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"k88","type":"text","x":3240,"y":4830,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"2","text":"## [[投资论点核验]]\n\n约定证据，再按新事实更新。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSpecify evidence and update with new facts.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"kscenario","type":"text","x":4100,"y":4830,"width":500,"height":240,"color":"2","text":"## [[情景预测]]\n\n复用一致条件未来，不编造概率。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nReuse coherent conditional futures without invented probabilities.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"}
	],
